# Build artifacts
build/
compile_commands.json
compile_commands.json.tmp
*.o
*.bin
!resource/vgafont.bin
*.elf
*.img
fsroot/
tools/mkexe/mkexe
tools/mkexe/*.o
tools/mkfat/mkfat
tools/lwcon/lwcon

# Logs
*.log

# The lwos.dev site (site/). Source and assets are tracked;
# dependencies and build output are not — Cloudflare Workers Builds runs
# `pnpm build` followed by `wrangler deploy` on every push.
site/node_modules/
site/dist/
site/.astro/
.pnpm-store/

# 在线试玩: 镜像不进仓库 —— CI 每次把最新构建挂到固定 tag 的 GitHub Release
# 上滚动覆盖, demo 页从那里匿名拉取. make webimg 只写本地调试用的那份.
site/public/assets/demo/

# v86 的两个 BIOS 文件是特意 vendored 的 (npm 包不带 BIOS), 别被上面的 *.bin 挡掉
!site/public/vendor/v86/bios/seabios.bin
!site/public/vendor/v86/bios/vgabios.bin

# SPEC/ and report/ are tracked on purpose — do not ignore
